g from the west, and the totem guards with it.","msg.2.who":"Captain Isolde","msg.3":"The last wave comes from the east. Hold!","msg.3.who":"Captain Isolde","msg.4":"Dawn. The packs fall back to their totems. Now we strike.","msg.4.who":"Captain Isolde","msg.5":"The last totem breaks. The night packs will not return.","msg.5.who":"Captain Isolde","win":"The totems fall and a hidden stair under the fort stands open.","fail.1":"Your hero has fallen. Ravenwatch is lost."},"day":4950}